---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { brand } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base locale="zh" title={`404 — ${brand.name}`} description="页面未找到。Page not found." noindex><main id="main" class="error-page container"><span class="error-code">404</span><h1>这条路径还没有下一步。</h1><p>页面不存在。The page you're looking for doesn't exist.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="/zh/">返回首页<Icon size={16}/></a><a class="button button-secondary" href="/en/docs/quickstart/">English docs<Icon name="book" size={16}/></a></div></main></Base>
